# Coverage probe — what the acceptance suite executes, and what it never touches
#
#   node deepblend/tools/coverage-probe.mjs --all --keep    (the run this log came from)
#
# Instrument: NODE_V8_COVERAGE on every process the suite spawns, merged per process and then
# unioned (see the tool's header for the three wrong merges that came before it).
#
# TWO READINGS ARE PRINTED, and they have different denominators:
#   [every line]  every line of the file, comments included — comparable with §36's 13.7%
#   [code lines]  blank and comment-only lines removed — "code that was never executed"
# The second is the one to read. A comment cannot be unexecuted, and a metric whose tail is prose
# sends people after a gap that does not exist. §36 was written against the first.

